# The vendored WICK enemy pack (docs/wick-enemies). Not ours to reformat.
#
# The pack ships with an explicit instruction that its comments carry design reasoning which is
# expensive to reconstruct, and its formatting is part of that: the keyframe tracks in every enemy
# module are authored as one dense line per pose so a whole animation reads as a column of poses.
# StyLua would explode each of those into a paragraph and make the tracks unreadable as animation,
# which is the one thing about these files that must survive contact with this repo.
#
# Anything WE write against the pack (Config/*, server/*, client/*) is formatted normally.
src/shared/Enemies/
